        <mxCell id="CbssgIBA4dZ7nhPmCREy-1" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Preduslov: &lt;/b&gt;Vodic je prijavljen&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Posledica: &lt;/b&gt;Za deo slozene ture je zakazan termin i kreirana tura&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Osnovni tok:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:4px;&quot;&gt;1. Vodic uradi klikne na dugme &quot;Tour requests&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:4px;&quot;&gt;2. U novootvorenom prozoru vodic bira meni &quot;Complex tours&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:4px;&quot;&gt;3. Vodicu se prikazuju svi zahtevi za slozene ture&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:4px;&quot;&gt;4. [Alternativni tok A]&lt;/p&gt;" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="30" width="390" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CbssgIBA4dZ7nhPmCREy-2" value="&lt;b&gt;Alternativni tok A:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Pregled detalja slozene ture" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=26;fillColor=none;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="490" y="30" width="300" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CbssgIBA4dZ7nhPmCREy-3" value="1. Vodic odabere odredjeni zahtev za slozenu turu a zatim klikne na dugme&amp;nbsp;&quot;View the details of the selected complex tour&quot;&lt;br&gt;2. Vodicu se prikazu svi delovi slozene ture i detalji&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; vezani za iste&lt;br&gt;3. [Alternativni tok B]" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="CbssgIBA4dZ7nhPmCREy-2">
          <mxGeometry y="26" width="300" height="104" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CbssgIBA4dZ7nhPmCREy-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Alternativni tok B: &lt;/b&gt;Prikaz svih detalja vezanih za deo zahteva" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=26;fillColor=none;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="490" y="180" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CbssgIBA4dZ7nhPmCREy-8" value="1. Vodic uradi dvoklik na odredjeni deo&lt;br&gt;2. Vodicu se prikaze prozor sa svim detaljima o delu ture i&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;dugmetom za prihvatanje dela ture&lt;br&gt;3.[Alternativni tok C]" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="CbssgIBA4dZ7nhPmCREy-4">
          <mxGeometry y="26" width="340" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CbssgIBA4dZ7nhPmCREy-6" value="&lt;b&gt;Alternativni tok C: &lt;/b&gt;Prihvatanje dela ture" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=26;fillColor=none;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="460" y="290" width="380" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CbssgIBA4dZ7nhPmCREy-7" value="1. Vodic unese termin za kada zeli da zakaze turu i klikne na dugme &quot;Schedule&quot;&lt;br&gt;2. Pokrece se slucaj &quot;Dodavanje ture&quot; sa zadatim parametrima [Alternativni tok D]&lt;br&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="CbssgIBA4dZ7nhPmCREy-6">
          <mxGeometry y="26" width="380" height="104" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CbssgIBA4dZ7nhPmCREy-9" value="&lt;b&gt;Alternativni tok C: &lt;/b&gt;Termin je odbijen" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=26;fillColor=none;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="460" y="430" width="380" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CbssgIBA4dZ7nhPmCREy-10" value="1. Vodic dobija obavestenje da ne moze da prihvati deo ture jer je vec prihvatio jedan deo u istoj kompleksnoj turi ili je taj termin vec zauzet" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="CbssgIBA4dZ7nhPmCREy-9">
